<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - June 27.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - June 27.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the Mid-Session of Friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.The index at the Mid-session was 4131.71, 15.15 points or 0.56 percent higher than Thursday close.</p>
